# B12 gigaspeech -- the original data-scaling grid, rerun. Generated by scripts/gen_campaign_configs.py
# 87 cells x 2 regimes (fixed_budget `_fb`, data_limited `_dl`), minus 2 already in B1.
# `_fb` reproduces the manuscript's REPORTED runs: full-pool step budget at every
# fraction, so a 10% run repeats its subset ~10x. `_dl` is one pass over the subset.
# Single seed 42; replication is over SUBSETS, as in the original.
# Corpus order is priority: VoxPopuli has 0 of 36 original artifacts, SPGISpeech
# 33 of 39, GigaSpeech 12 of 12. Slippage should drop the corpus that has its numbers.
